   pale axis cross on each plane         → 2 × Line                       #d5d5d5
   input cloud (240 wide gaussian dots)  → InstancedMesh(Sphere 0.09)     saturated #ee2222
   collapsed output locus (ghost bar)    → InstancedMesh(Sphere 0.09) at y=+3, spans ±2.35
   trajectories (2 strands, dashed)      → LineSegments, vertexColors: red below, pink above
   converging gray frame lines + tails   → LineSegments (manual dashes)   #a8a8a8
   front-corner vertical + extension     → LineSegments (manual dashes)   #a8a8a8
   corner dots (left / right / below)    → 3 × SphereGeometry(0.09)       #9a9a9a
   arrowheads at ±2.9 on upper plane     → 2 × ConeGeometry(0.13,0.32)    #9a9a9a
   arrow guide line through locus        → LineSegments (manual dashes)   #c4c4c4
   label leader for 1-D locus            → Line                          #cc1414
   pick plane at y=+3 (invisible)        → Mesh(PlaneGeometry) opacity 0
